  "expirationDate": "2020-10-04",
  "historyNote": "#1879, eff 12-3-81; ss by #2539, eff 11-18-83; amd by #2778, eff 7-24-84; ss by #4814, eff 5-16-90; ss by #5308, eff 1-16-92; ss by #5772, eff 1-11-94; ss by #6046-b, eff 6-1-95; ss by #6577, eff 9-13-97; amd by #7436, eff 1-26-01; ss by #7555, eff 9-12-01; ss by #7828, eff 2-13-03; ss by #8097, eff 6-11-04; ss by #8655, eff 6-9-06; amd by #9047, eff 12-12-07; amd by #9652, eff 2-3-10; ss by #10144, eff 6-7-12; ss by #10412-B, eff 9-19-13; ss by #11055, eff 3-18-16; ss by #13018, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-7-20, EXPIRED: 10-4-20",
